# Prompt Data

## Case Metadata
- Case ID: {{ case.case_id }}
- Tax Year: {{ case.tax_year }}
- Residency State: {{ case.filing.residency_state }}
- Federal Filing Status: {{ case.filing.federal_status }}
- State Filing Status: {{ case.filing.state_status }}

## Taxpayer
- Name: {{ case.taxpayer.first_name }} {{ case.taxpayer.last_name }}
- SSN: {{ case.taxpayer.ssn }}
- Occupation: {{ case.taxpayer.occupation }}
- Employer: {{ case.taxpayer.employer }}

{% if case.spouse %}
## Spouse
- Name: {{ case.spouse.first_name }} {{ case.spouse.last_name }}
- SSN: {{ case.spouse.ssn }}
- Occupation: {{ case.spouse.occupation }}
- Employer: {{ case.spouse.employer }}
{% endif %}

## Address
- Street: {{ case.address.street }}
- City: {{ case.address.city }}
- State: {{ case.address.state }}
- ZIP: {{ case.address.zip_code }}

## Dependents
{% if case.dependents and case.dependents|length > 0 %}
{% for dep in case.dependents %}
- {{ dep.first_name }} {{ dep.last_name }} | {{ dep.relationship }} | SSN: {{ dep.ssn }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- None
{% endif %}

## Income Inputs
- W-2 Wages: {% if case.income_documents.w2 %}${{ case.income_documents.w2.wages_box1 }}{% else %}$0{% endif %}
- Interest Income: {% if case.income_documents.interest_1099_int %}${{ case.income_documents.interest_1099_int.taxable_interest }}{% else %}$0{% endif %}
- Dividend Income: {% if case.income_documents.dividend_1099_div %}${{ case.income_documents.dividend_1099_div.ordinary_dividends }}{% else %}$0{% endif %}
- Qualified Dividends: {% if case.income_documents.dividend_1099_div %}${{ case.income_documents.dividend_1099_div.qualified_dividends }}{% else %}$0{% endif %}
- Business Income (Schedule C): {% if case.income_documents.schedule_c and case.income_documents.schedule_c.get('net_profit') is not none %}${{ case.income_documents.schedule_c.get('net_profit') }}{% else %}$0{% endif %}

## Expected Outputs
- Federal Total Income: ${{ case.federal_return.total_income }}
- Federal AGI: ${{ case.federal_return.agi }}
- Federal Standard Deduction: ${{ case.federal_return.standard_deduction }}
- Federal Taxable Income: ${{ case.federal_return.taxable_income }}
- Federal Tax Before Credits: ${{ case.federal_return.tax_before_credits }}
- Federal Child Tax Credit: ${{ case.federal_return.child_tax_credit }}
- Federal Total Tax: ${{ case.federal_return.total_tax }}
- Federal Total Payments: ${{ case.federal_return.total_payments }}
- Federal Refund: ${{ case.federal_return.refund }}
- Federal Balance Due: ${{ case.federal_return.balance_due }}

## State Outputs
- State Code: {{ case.state_return.state_code }}
- State AGI: ${{ case.state_return.state_agi }}
- State Standard Deduction: ${{ case.state_return.standard_deduction }}
- State Taxable Income: ${{ case.state_return.taxable_income }}
- State Tax Before Credits: ${{ case.state_return.tax_before_credits }}
- State Total Tax: ${{ case.state_return.total_tax }}
- State Total Payments: ${{ case.state_return.total_payments }}
- State Refund: ${{ case.state_return.refund }}
- State Balance Due: ${{ case.state_return.balance_due }}